hfit.com\/products\/merach-r50-rowing-machine-with-air-resistance\">Merach R50 &gt;&gt;&gt;<\/a><\/p>"}},"testimonial_wxrMnA":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/merach_uk_halloween_sale_6_-2.jpg","round_avatar":true,"show_rating":true,"rating":5,"author":"David S.","title":"Very Stable--S26B2","content":"<p>Fantastic bike, easy to assemble can be put together within an hour, pretty heavy to move even with the wheels but it is very stable when riding. <\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/uk.merachfit.com\/products\/merach-s26b2-indoor-exercise-bike-with-magnetic-resistance\" title=\"https:\/\/uk.merachfit.com\/products\/merach-s26b2-indoor-exercise-bike-with-magnetic-resistance\">Merach S26B2&gt;&gt;&gt;<\/a><br\/><br\/><\/p>"}},"testimonial_MnqJLp":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/merach_uk_halloween_sale_1_-2.jpg","round_avatar":true,"show_rating":true,"rating":5,"author":"Jojo","title":"Automatic Incline--W50","content":"<p>The automatic incline is so easy to adjust. Very quiet and although it says it’s a walking pad the fastest speed makes you run. <\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/uk.merachfit.com\/products\/merach-w50-treadmill-with-12-auto-incline\" title=\"https:\/\/uk.merachfit.com\/products\/merach-w50-treadmill-with-12-auto-incline\">Merach W50&gt;&gt;&gt;<\/a><\/p>"}},"testimonial_mDEULq":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/merach_uk_halloween_sale_2_-2.jpg","round_avatar":true,"show_rating":true,"rating":5,"author":"Linda","title":"Save Space--R15","content":"<p>Excellent machine, folds up neatly, doesn't take up much space when folded.<\/p><p><br\/><a href=\"https:\/\/uk.merachfit.com\/products\/merach-r15-magnetic-rowing-machine\" title=\"https:\/\/uk.merachfit.com\/products\/merach-r15-magnetic-rowing-machine\">Merach R15B2&gt;&gt;&gt;<\/a><\/p>"}},"testimonial_mztjPa":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/merach_uk_halloween_sale_4_-2.jpg","round_avatar":true,"show_rating":true,"rating":5,"author":"Anderson","title":"So Much Stronger--R50","content":"<p>Fantastic rowing machine !!! This was my third attempt at getting a good strong rowing machine and I am so pleased with it. Tried magnetic but lasted only a few weeks before it lost its resistance this one however seems so much stronger. <\/p><p><\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/uk.merachfit.com\/products\/merach-r50-rowing-machine-with-air-resistance\" title=\"https:\/\/uk.merachfit.com\/products\/merach-r50-rowing-machine-with-air-resistance\">Merach R50&gt;&gt;&gt;<\/a><\/p>"}},"testimonial_39CHC7":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/merach_uk_halloween_sale_5_-2.jpg","round_avatar":true,"show_rating":true,"rating":5,"author":"Amelia","title":"Move Very Smoothly--S08","content":"<p>Great experience bike and more suitable if you have disabilities. Easy to adjust the levels. This is very sturdy. It move very smoothly and you can work up a sweat with this.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/uk.merachfit.com\/products\/merach-s08b1-recumbent-exercise-bike\" title=\"https:\/\/uk.merachfit.com\/products\/merach-s08b1-recumbent-exercise-bike\">Merach S08&gt;&gt;&gt;<\/a><\/p>"}}},"block_order":["testimonial_tVWFnU","testimonial_wxrMnA","testimonial_MnqJLp","testimonial_mDEULq","testimonial_mztjPa","testimonial_39CHC7"],"name":"Testimonials","settings":{"anchor_id":"testimonials","full_width":true,"stack_testimonials":false,"subheading":"","title":"","content":"","link_url":"","link_text":"","background":"#000000","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"","testimonial_card_background":"","testimonial_card_text_color":"#f8f8f8","scrollbar_bg":"white","scrollbar_bg_step":"rgba(255,255,255,.3)","slide_button_color":"#ffffff"}}},"order":["main","image_with_text_overlay_6hnT9T","custom_navbar_PEYD4r","compose_marquee_4dDdGE","media_with_product_xftqb7","pure_collections_container_AX8xiL","rich_text_gVg